  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FY24-25 ASEAN Public Sector Leadership Mid-level In-Country</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A course for 30 officials from across ASEAN and Timor-Leste run over 4 weeks, designed to improve public sector efficiency and effectiveness.&#xa0; The course will cover strategic leadership, people leadership, delivery management and ethics and transparency, as well as communication skills, project management and information management.
This course will be delivered in February 2025, by Wellington Uni Professionals.</narrative>
  </description>
